==Battleground==
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[CTO Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**4 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**6 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Meatshielding is essential here. Since the boss doesn't appear until you've hit the base, the meat shields buy you time to fill your wallet. From there, spam a combination of your best ranged attackers and anti-red cats. CTO Seal is a fast, relentless attacker who also freezes your front line, and with Rain D knocking them back, it doesn't take long to get overwhelmed if you don't have enough buffer. A recommended lineup would include 4-5 meatshields, [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], and fill the rest of the slots with fast attackers, long-range, and anti-red/traited cats like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]], [[Hatsune Miku (Uber Rare Cat)|Hatsune Miku]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]], [[Mighty Rekon Korps (Uber Rare Cat)|Orbital Platform Armageddon]], and [[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Guild Heroes]].

